# The login screen's user (docs/adr/0020-oxy-account-login.mdx): a system user with no password and
# no shell, in no group but its own; logind gives its session the seat's devices. Installed as
# /usr/lib/sysusers.d/oxyos-login.conf.
u oxyos-login - "OxyOS login screen" /var/lib/oxyos-login /usr/sbin/nologin
